    your opponent controls to the hand, also, after that, if "Dream Mirror of Terror"
    is on the field, draw 1 card, then shuffle 1 card from your hand into the Deck.
    You can only use each effect of "Neiroy, the Dream Mirror Disciple" once per
    turn.'
